# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TOP-LEVEL: DENY BY DEFAULT
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The chezmoi source root IS the git repo root, so any un-prefixed top-level
# entry — docs/, test/, a build artifact, a stray lib, README.md — would mirror
# straight into ~. So: ignore EVERY top-level entry, then allow ONLY the dotfiles
# chezmoi should deploy. A new top-level source entry is IGNORED until you add
# its `!/<dest-name>` line below. (`/*` matches one path segment, so files nested
# inside an allowed dir are unaffected and deploy normally.)
/*
!/.authinfo
!/.claude
!/.claude-ijcd
!/.config
!/.editorconfig
!/.hammerspoon
!/.homebrew
!/.local
!/.ssh
!/.vim
!/.zshenv
!/authinfo-keychain.sh            # run_once_before_ keychain bootstrap (a script, not a deployed file)
!/brew-trust-taps.sh              # run_once_after_ brew-trust bootstrap (a script, not a deployed file)

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MISC (any level)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
**/.DS_Store
**/.Trash
*.txt

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CARVE-OUTS inside allowed dirs — machine-local / generated / secret
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.config/zsh/.zcompdump
.config/chezmoi                   # chezmoi's own state
.config/hub                       # GitHub credentials
.config/iterm2                    # machine-specific
.config/nix/result                # nix build output (symlink)
.config/emacs                     # separate git repo (dotemacs)
.config/zed                       # syncs via account
.local/share                      # XDG runtime data
.local/state                      # XDG runtime data
.ssh/*                            # never commit private keys
!.ssh/config                      # ...except the managed agent/keychain config

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ~/.claude — track only specific config; the rest is local AI state.
# LOCKSTEP: each tracked file below is ALSO symlinked into ~/.claude-ijcd via
# private_dot_claude-ijcd/symlink_<name>. Track a new file here → add a matching
# symlink_<name> there so both account profiles share it.
# Credentials are deliberately NOT tracked — per-account secret, Keychain/file,
# machine-local. (Never re-add !.claude/.credentials.json.)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/statusline.sh
!.claude/skills
!.claude/hooks
!.claude/hooks/**
!.claude/RTK.md
!.claude/.rtk-version
.claude.json*
